rt's content to a full-blown single-player story mode that digs deep into this world with possible sinister intentions. It is up to you how you want to play and fantastically evolve!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a Horse. You play as a wild horse with a freeform camera. It is you versus the world avoiding being captured. Natural disasters involving the elements, man, and gravity are your enemy. Preserve and increase your herd through your offspring, extending your lineage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328040/extras/b0f507dd8dae56ad224fa57937afe086.poster.avif?t=1755708666\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328040/extras/b0f507dd8dae56ad224fa57937afe086.webm?t=1755708666\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328040/extras/b0f507dd8dae56ad224fa57937afe086.mp4?t=1755708666\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br> <br>You have no weapons, no rider, and a limited to no onscreen user interface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328040/extras/8a90bda7f8596f016a591f1ca1c953a6.poster.avif?t=1755708666\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328040/extras/8a90bda7f8596f016a591f1ca1c953a6.webm?t=1755708666\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328040/extras/8a90bda7f8596f016a591f1ca1c953a6.mp4?t=1755708666\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From a casual play mode for simply exploring to your heart's content to a full-blown single-player story mode that digs deep into this world with possible sinister intentions. It is up to you how you want to play and fantastically evolve!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "You are a Horse. As a Horse with a freeform camera, it is you -vs- the world, surviving the elements &amp; avoiding being captured. Increase your herd through your offspring, extending your lineage. Either play casually, exploring vast environments or go deep into the story &amp; see how your Horse evolves.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328040/header.jpg?t=1755708666", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328040/3f55d888a76143fa79898440780980ab1d4b7ec4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755708666", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328040/3f55d888a76143fa79898440780980ab1d4b7ec4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755708666", "website": "https://horseevolutions.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 - 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel® Core™ i5-2500K / AMD FX-6300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 770 2GB or an AMD Radeon R9 280 3GB<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 75 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Direct X Compatible</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 - 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel® Core™ i7-4770K / AMD Ryzen 5 1500X<br></li><